---
import SeoPage from "@/components/SeoPage.astro";
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout>
  <SeoPage slot="head" title="About" />
  <div>
    <h1
      style="font-size: 34px; font-weight: 700; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 30px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; line-height: 1.15;"
    >
      About
    </h1>
    <p style="margin: 0 0 18px;">
      <span
        style="float: left; font-size: 64px; line-height: 0.85; font-weight: 700; padding-right: 10px; padding-top: 6px;"
        >R</span
      >
      abbitholes is a writing project that digs unnecessarily deep into things that
      in all honesty are interesting and cool and fun, but don't really matter. Mostly
      Rust.
    </p>
    <p style="margin: 0 0 18px; clear: left;">
      I keep notes in public. The notes are not always finished. That is on
      purpose.
    </p>
    <p style="margin: 0 0 18px;">
      This site is set in <em>Geist Mono</em> at 14px, on a paper-toned background.
      There are no trackers and no analytics. There is one RSS feed and it lives
      at
      <a href="/rss.xml" style="border-bottom: 1px solid currentColor;"
        >/rss.xml</a
      >.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
